            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_db63a0fa">
               <titlePage label="Title page" xml:id="titlePage_273N2005A">
                  <p xml:id="idm32">Ouverture til "Coreggio", Op. 59</p>
               </titlePage>
               <extent xml:id="extent_1990b47e">60 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_a2c5b4b3">33.5 x 29</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_6834cee0">Bound in brown cloth with golden letters: "Ouverture / til / CORREGGIO. / Part." A copy of the printed programme for the first performance in Musikforeningen on 19 December 1860 has been glued to a piece of paper placed before the title page. Written in brown ink. Paper: 12 staves (unpaginated title page) and 19 staves (score). Paginated in upper left/right-hand corner in pencil in foreign hand. Bar numbers added in pencil and red crayon. Hartmann's original letters emphazised in blue crayon. Beneath the last four bars signed and dated: "I:P:E:Hartmann / Op. 59. 1/6 58."</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
